  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>已封存</strong></h1><p>死亡計數器是一款伺服器端的Minecraft Fabric模組，能直接從玩家統計資料中獲取玩家死亡次數，確保數據即時準確。支援<a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/death-counter#server-side-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebAPI</a>及客戶端<a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/death-counter#client-side-webui\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebUI</a>功能。您亦可透過<a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/death-counter#commands-and-permission\" rel=\"nofollow\">指令</a>在遊戲中即時查閱。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\">其他模組僅能從安裝後開始計算死亡次數，而本模組能追溯安裝前的死亡紀錄。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>更多資訊請見<a href=\"https://github.com/syorito-hatsuki/death-counter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://img.fstats.dev/timeline/34?mode=week\" width=\"1067\" height=\"400\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支援</span></p><hr><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pbwnMwnUD6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://external-content.duckduckgo.com/iu/?u=https://boulevardduweb.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/discord-cover.png&amp;f=1&amp;nofb=1&amp;ipt=75e3577353828086690ec5ed17dd4397267a318bb0e904daee4fef55e777b6e1&amp;ipo=images\" alt=\"Discord français Social Media et Marketing Digital - Boulevard du Web\" width=\"392\" height=\"112\"></a></p>",
